Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Carry plugin animated layers (maplibre-native#4654)

Backports the merged upstream animation callback from Native commit
3db2ced57652d0329fe2703148bc10dc5eb32f8d, preserving the upstream stencil
and near-clipped matrix fields. Drop when the FFI Native pin includes it.

Carried by maplibre-plugins until the Native pin includes the change.
